// src/training/data.js
// Content for Personal Tools › Training: exercises, how-to details, programs,
// stretches and the sports they are written for. Pure data, no browser code,
// so it is easy to edit and to test. The UI and timer live in
// src/views/training.js and src/training/player.js; the maths (prescriptions,
// cool-down building, session generation) in src/training/engine.js.
//
// To add a sport: add it to SPORTS and PROGRAMS, then a line to SPORT_WHY
// wherever its reason for an exercise differs from the general one in WHY.
// To add an exercise: EXERCISES, DETAILS and WHY (and PROGRAMS if the plan
// should use it).


